(5448919, 783742, 105171, '<td valign="top">The image fits so well with the challenge.  The sharpness and depth of field with the dark background enhances the quality of the image.  I like the still lingering violet color on the petals.  Well done.</td>', 'The image fits so well with the challenge.  The sharpness and depth of field with the dark background enhances the quality of the image.  I like the still lingering violet color on the petals.  Well done.', '2009-04-22 17:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5449088, 784192, 101256, '<td valign="top">A mushroom of course. Very creative and clever use of props to create something unusual and "not quite right". The image is a little too tall to be completely effective - the extra space redirects the eye away from the subject. Well done.</td>', 'A mushroom of course. Very creative and clever use of props to create something unusual and "not quite right". The image is a little too tall to be completely effective - the extra space redirects the eye away from the subject. Well done.', '2009-04-22 19:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5449092, 782886, 101256, '<td valign="top">This one is very hard to rate because there are two ways of looking at it: 1 - DUDE THAT IS JUST WRONG!! and 2 - Dude that just ain''t quite right, ''cha know? Very ingenious and it does have a certain black humor about it - clearly outside of the box thinking about "not quite right".  Well done.</td>', 'This one is very hard to rate because there are two ways of looking at it: 1 - DUDE THAT IS JUST WRONG!! and 2 - Dude that just ain''t quite right, ''cha know? Very ingenious and it does have a certain black humor about it - clearly outside of the box thinking about "not quite right".  Well done.', '2009-04-22 19:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5449099, 784011, 101256, '<td valign="top">A sad end for a once grand old boat and that is not quite right.  A good solid entry into the challenge it might have been improved by a little closer look eliminating some of the background and concentrating on the boat itself. Well done.</td>', 'A sad end for a once grand old boat and that is not quite right.  A good solid entry into the challenge it might have been improved by a little closer look eliminating some of the background and concentrating on the boat itself. Well done.', '2009-04-22 19:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5449106, 783782, 101256, '<td valign="top">Having an event like this happen during a celebration or toast meets the Not Quite Right challenge criteria dead on - Well done. The image itself is nicely staged and composed with no major flaws to speak of. Well done.</td>', 'Having an event like this happen during a celebration or toast meets the Not Quite Right challenge criteria dead on - Well done. The image itself is nicely staged and composed with no major flaws to speak of. Well done.', '2009-04-22 19:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5449114, 782922, 28975, '<td valign="top">you are one sick mother f----- that poor hamster, did he taste good? You should have used a better looking guy, i am sure you know somone that is better looking than this twat, but then maybe the good looking guys would not eat hamster. I marked you a 10 for being so brave,  PS plesee cut the hair hanging out of your ear, i am eating my dinner</td>', 'you are one sick mother f----- that poor hamster, did he taste good? You should have used a better looking guy, i am sure you know somone that is better looking than this twat, but then maybe the good looking guys would not eat hamster. I marked you a 10 for being so brave,  PS plesee cut the hair hanging out of your ear, i am eating my dinner', '2009-04-22 19:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5449121, 783742, 101256, '<td valign="top">The image meets the challenge criteria in a unique way - very interesting viewpoint on "Not Quite Right", although this is a natural process - birth, life, death, etc., it certainly can be viewed as such. A good effort with the image being a little soft on the focus to be truly effective.</td>', 'The image meets the challenge criteria in a unique way - very interesting viewpoint on "Not Quite Right", although this is a natural process - birth, life, death, etc., it certainly can be viewed as such. A good effort with the image being a little soft on the focus to be truly effective.', '2009-04-22 19:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5449127, 784305, 101256, '<td valign="top">A sense of humor in challenges like these are always appreciated and when they meet the challenge criteria head on, it is a pleasant experience for the viewer. The image is nice, crisp and the melding of two disparate ideas of the rough ready underground worker and afternoon tea is just delicious (pun intended). Well done.</td>', 'A sense of humor in challenges like these are always appreciated and when they meet the challenge criteria head on, it is a pleasant experience for the viewer. The image is nice, crisp and the melding of two disparate ideas of the rough ready underground worker and afternoon tea is just delicious (pun intended). Well done.', '2009-04-22 19:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5449132, 784275, 101256, '<td valign="top">Humor is always appreciated and this is a good example of how to express an idea by combining two different concepts into one. The image is technically sufficient to tie the whole concept together. Well done.</td>', 'Humor is always appreciated and this is a good example of how to express an idea by combining two different concepts into one. The image is technically sufficient to tie the whole concept together. Well done.', '2009-04-22 19:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5449134, 783556, 101256, '<td valign="top">This goes right on past from Not Quite Right straight into Dude, that is just wrong. A clever angle and a good capture with the backlight and proper shadow control. A very worthy entry into the challenge.</td>', 'This goes right on past from Not Quite Right straight into Dude, that is just wrong. A clever angle and a good capture with the backlight and proper shadow control. A very worthy entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-22 19:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5449136, 783412, 101256, '<td valign="top">Stranded coastal vessels, in particular ones like this, are like disrespecting their great heritage which, when viewed from that perspective, is Not Quite Right. A terrific image in and of itself meets the challenge in a unique way.</td>', 'Stranded coastal vessels, in particular ones like this, are like disrespecting their great heritage which, when viewed from that perspective, is Not Quite Right. A terrific image in and of itself meets the challenge in a unique way.', '2009-04-22 19:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5449139, 783921, 101256, '<td valign="top">Snow and motorcycles certainly meets the definition of Not Quite Right and as such meets the challenge criteria in fine fashion. With respect to the image, it might have been better to get in a little closer and work with some bokeh to increase it''s visual impact. A good solid entry into the challenge.</td>', 'Snow and motorcycles certainly meets the definition of Not Quite Right and as such meets the challenge criteria in fine fashion. With respect to the image, it might have been better to get in a little closer and work with some bokeh to increase it''s visual impact. A good solid entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-22 19:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5449140, 783921, 40718, '<td valign="top">Dude!  Is that a KZ900?  I rode one of those for a few years.  It was a beast.  Sat in my parents garage for years until last month when my dad sold it for $100.  Apparently it''s running without too much trouble.  Gas had leaked into the engine and actually kept everything from rusting.</td>', 'Dude!  Is that a KZ900?  I rode one of those for a few years.  It was a beast.  Sat in my parents garage for years until last month when my dad sold it for $100.  Apparently it''s running without too much trouble.  Gas had leaked into the engine and actually kept everything from rusting.', '2009-04-22 19:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5449141, 784434, 101256, '<td valign="top">Well, it took a minute to figure it out, but the light finally dawned on Marblehead - a great image and a terrific action capture that fully meets the challenge criteria. From a image standpoint, it could use a little more crop off the bottom and left side, but it''s just fine as it is - that would have been a personal choice. Well done - a classic Not Quite Right - very clever.</td>', 'Well, it took a minute to figure it out, but the light finally dawned on Marblehead - a great image and a terrific action capture that fully meets the challenge criteria. From a image standpoint, it could use a little more crop off the bottom and left side, but it''s just fine as it is - that would have been a personal choice. Well done - a classic Not Quite Right - very clever.', '2009-04-22 19:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5449142, 784296, 101256, '<td valign="top">A sense of humor goes a long way towards making a pleasant viewing experience. A clearly effective and humorous way to meet the challenge criteria, this clearly is Not Quite Right. The use of bokeh and the back lighting is very good and gives the image some pop and impact. Well done.</td>', 'A sense of humor goes a long way towards making a pleasant viewing experience. A clearly effective and humorous way to meet the challenge criteria, this clearly is Not Quite Right. The use of bokeh and the back lighting is very good and gives the image some pop and impact. Well done.', '2009-04-22 19:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5449146, 783535, 101256, '<td valign="top">This is really funny and is so Not Quite Right it zips right into the rare atmosphere of Bizzaro World. Very clever and unique, this has to be a top ten image if not a ribbon winner - it''s just terrific. Well done.</td>', 'This is really funny and is so Not Quite Right it zips right into the rare atmosphere of Bizzaro World. Very clever and unique, this has to be a top ten image if not a ribbon winner - it''s just terrific. Well done.', '2009-04-22 19:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5449148, 783020, 101256, '<td valign="top">Sometimes a photographers stumbles on an image that just makes one''s shoot worth while. The head''s angle and the slightly "What?" look to the bird''s visage is very funny. Nothing wrong with the image either - nicely detailed with no major or minor flaws worth noting. Very effective while meeting the challenge criteria.  Well done.</td>', 'Sometimes a photographers stumbles on an image that just makes one''s shoot worth while. The head''s angle and the slightly "What?" look to the bird''s visage is very funny. Nothing wrong with the image either - nicely detailed with no major or minor flaws worth noting. Very effective while meeting the challenge criteria.  Well done.', '2009-04-22 19:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5449153, 784263, 101256, '<td valign="top">Once again, this challenge seems to be providing submitters with reasons to move into humorous mode and produce some great images. This clearly meets the criteria, although a different title would have helped the image be a little more ambiguous giving the viewer an excuse to really look at the image. A good solid entry into the challenge presented with a sense of whimsy. Well done.</td>', 'Once again, this challenge seems to be providing submitters with reasons to move into humorous mode and produce some great images. This clearly meets the criteria, although a different title would have helped the image be a little more ambiguous giving the viewer an excuse to really look at the image. A good solid entry into the challenge presented with a sense of whimsy. Well done.', '2009-04-22 19:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5449156, 783158, 101256, '<td valign="top">Wouldn''t QWERTY be POIUYT? :&gt;) Very clever image, excellant lighting and focus control and the humor behind the idea carries the technical perfection to the next level. An excellant entry into the challenge, this should be a top ten finisher and a potential ribbon winner. Well done.</td>', 'Wouldn''t QWERTY be POIUYT? :>) Very clever image, excellant lighting and focus control and the humor behind the idea carries the technical perfection to the next level. An excellant entry into the challenge, this should be a top ten finisher and a potential ribbon winner. Well done.', '2009-04-22 19:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5449164, 784409, 101256, '<td valign="top">Sometimes, an image is just so perfect that it defies description. This is one of them. While this reviewer is not totally convinced of the author''s intent, it is certainly unusual and as such meets the challenge criteria. This is simply beautiful. Well done.</td>', 'Sometimes, an image is just so perfect that it defies description. This is one of them. While this reviewer is not totally convinced of the author''s intent, it is certainly unusual and as such meets the challenge criteria. This is simply beautiful. Well done.', '2009-04-22 20:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
