(5449276, 784305, 106148, '<td valign="top">Definitely out of his "MINE" but I like it. The quality of the photo is surreal, neat.</td>', 'Definitely out of his "MINE" but I like it. The quality of the photo is surreal, neat.', '2009-04-22 21:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5449302, 784229, 106148, '<td valign="top">Nice. I''ve been tempted myself (on occasion) to do the same, lol.<br/> <br/>Maybe a more subtle background? The white is nice, but just a bit bright. <br/>Nevertheless the photo and area of focus is SHARP, the composition is good and I like how the hammer comes in DIRECTLY from the corner of the photo....meticulous much? Guess one has to be when puzzeling pieces with a hammer. Careful!!!Lol. Well done.</td>', 'Nice. I''ve been tempted myself (on occasion) to do the same, lol. Maybe a more subtle background? The white is nice, but just a bit bright. Nevertheless the photo and area of focus is SHARP, the composition is good and I like how the hammer comes in DIRECTLY from the corner of the photo....meticulous much? Guess one has to be when puzzeling pieces with a hammer. Careful!!!Lol. Well done.', '2009-04-22 21:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5449305, 783949, 106148, '<td valign="top">LOL. NIce.</td>', 'LOL. NIce.', '2009-04-22 21:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5449315, 784400, 106148, '<td valign="top">Nice.... photo,composition,DOP,rule of third.<br/> <br/>I also like how there''s very subtle tints of pink.<br/>I''d say "P" for Pinkieeeeee...."P" for perfect. Well done.</td>', 'Nice.... photo,composition,DOP,rule of third. I also like how there''s very subtle tints of pink.I''d say "P" for Pinkieeeeee...."P" for perfect. Well done.', '2009-04-22 21:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5449322, 783853, 106148, '<td valign="top">The subject is very interesting. The placement on the steps was a good idea. I like the texture the carpeting adds to the photo and angle of the banister. Black &amp; White was a good choice for this pic. Nice. Interesting how the area of focus is the foot; while everything else managed to just make it....interesting.</td>', 'The subject is very interesting. The placement on the steps was a good idea. I like the texture the carpeting adds to the photo and angle of the banister. Black & White was a good choice for this pic. Nice. Interesting how the area of focus is the foot; while everything else managed to just make it....interesting.', '2009-04-22 21:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5449323, 784366, 106148, '<td valign="top">Better composition....better.....much better ;) (:</td>', 'Better composition....better.....much better ;) (:', '2009-04-22 21:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
