(5449336, 782459, 101256, '<td valign="top">Certainly unique and by comparison to the other buildings this is Not Quite Right. It''s an interesting free form sculpture and meets the challenge criteria quite nicely. Good eye - the image is crisp and sharp. Well done.</td>', 'Certainly unique and by comparison to the other buildings this is Not Quite Right. It''s an interesting free form sculpture and meets the challenge criteria quite nicely. Good eye - the image is crisp and sharp. Well done.', '2009-04-22 21:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
