(5449844, 784264, 74911, '<td valign="top">The background, setup concept and lighting looks good to me. <br/> <br/>There is a bit of blown out hightlights that is not working for me here, especially the details lost in places where the straws bend.</td>', 'The background, setup concept and lighting looks good to me.  There is a bit of blown out hightlights that is not working for me here, especially the details lost in places where the straws bend.', '2009-04-23 10:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5449846, 782641, 74911, '<td valign="top">For some reason I keep coming back to this image very often. The mood of the image, the concept, the setup, the processing or the background - not sure. But it looks good to me. The background goes very well. BTW what is RTK?</td>', 'For some reason I keep coming back to this image very often. The mood of the image, the concept, the setup, the processing or the background - not sure. But it looks good to me. The background goes very well. BTW what is RTK?', '2009-04-23 10:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5449850, 784439, 74911, '<td valign="top">The setup is amazing. I can see your efforts and brain behind this setup. The effect that this lighting has created is not very appealing to me though. Because of some lost details on the apple and the flowers due to highlights.</td>', 'The setup is amazing. I can see your efforts and brain behind this setup. The effect that this lighting has created is not very appealing to me though. Because of some lost details on the apple and the flowers due to highlights.', '2009-04-23 10:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5449852, 784073, 74911, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and setup. Hope this does well in this challenge.</td>', 'Nice lighting and setup. Hope this does well in this challenge.', '2009-04-23 10:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5449854, 783707, 74911, '<td valign="top">Great action shot, that fits the challenge aptly.</td>', 'Great action shot, that fits the challenge aptly.', '2009-04-23 10:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
