(5449937, 784364, 101256, '<td valign="top">It took a while to get the idea, but this is certainly a different look at the challenge subject. A very interesting capture and one that is unique. Very different. This would have worked as well in the "Candid" portion of the short term challenge. Well done.</td>', 'It took a while to get the idea, but this is certainly a different look at the challenge subject. A very interesting capture and one that is unique. Very different. This would have worked as well in the "Candid" portion of the short term challenge. Well done.', '2009-04-23 12:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5449940, 783971, 101256, '<td valign="top">Interesting that three of the entries were either taken at the same event or of the same subject.  A lot of horses on a small frame chassis does fit the bill of "not quite right". From an image standpoint, it might have helped to use a longer view or conversely a short view to increase the impact of the image in terms of "power", but it works as it is.</td>', 'Interesting that three of the entries were either taken at the same event or of the same subject.  A lot of horses on a small frame chassis does fit the bill of "not quite right". From an image standpoint, it might have helped to use a longer view or conversely a short view to increase the impact of the image in terms of "power", but it works as it is.', '2009-04-23 12:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5449941, 784189, 101256, '<td valign="top">A sort of "necker cube" imagery that is unique, colorful and very interesting. The image is somewhat flawed by the excess glue which detracts from the overall effect of the out of normal illusion. Good idea.</td>', 'A sort of "necker cube" imagery that is unique, colorful and very interesting. The image is somewhat flawed by the excess glue which detracts from the overall effect of the out of normal illusion. Good idea.', '2009-04-23 12:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5449942, 783853, 101256, '<td valign="top">A moment in time captured quickly and to great effect. A disturbing effect that clearly is not quite right.  Well done.</td>', 'A moment in time captured quickly and to great effect. A disturbing effect that clearly is not quite right.  Well done.', '2009-04-23 12:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5449946, 784014, 101256, '<td valign="top">Leaving the interpretation up to the viewer is very unique in this challenge and one that this reviewer appreciates - very interesting. A worthy entry into the challenge and a very nice image to compliment the idea. Well done.</td>', 'Leaving the interpretation up to the viewer is very unique in this challenge and one that this reviewer appreciates - very interesting. A worthy entry into the challenge and a very nice image to compliment the idea. Well done.', '2009-04-23 12:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
