(5455860, 783921, 105747, '<td valign="top">Subject matter is great. I may have shot this photo on a tripod at a slower shutter speed, so snow would be blurred as apposed to frozen in time. A little levels adjustment may have helped to lighten snow and improve contrast. I would have composed it a little different. I would have shot the Bike a little more up and to the left, and allowed some room for it to move in to the composition. You also would be in the rule of thirds. If you tried to convay the feeling of cold, you did a great job of that. Good Luck, Mike</td>', 'Subject matter is great. I may have shot this photo on a tripod at a slower shutter speed, so snow would be blurred as apposed to frozen in time. A little levels adjustment may have helped to lighten snow and improve contrast. I would have composed it a little different. I would have shot the Bike a little more up and to the left, and allowed some room for it to move in to the composition. You also would be in the rule of thirds. If you tried to convay the feeling of cold, you did a great job of that. Good Luck, Mike', '2009-04-28 17:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5455865, 783535, 105747, '<td valign="top">Great composition, looks like a lot of work. I don''t know exactly what you were trying to convey as for as not quite right. Good luck, Mike</td>', 'Great composition, looks like a lot of work. I don''t know exactly what you were trying to convey as for as not quite right. Good luck, Mike', '2009-04-28 17:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5455867, 784443, 105747, '<td valign="top">You are correct this is not quite right. This could be in "How did he do this". Great close up must have been a challange to shoot. Good Luck, Mike</td>', 'You are correct this is not quite right. This could be in "How did he do this". Great close up must have been a challange to shoot. Good Luck, Mike', '2009-04-28 17:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5455869, 783782, 105747, '<td valign="top">Now that is <b>creative</b> I hope no one got injured. This is not quite right. Good Luck, Mike</td>', 'Now that is creative I hope no one got injured. This is not quite right. Good Luck, Mike', '2009-04-28 17:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5455873, 784418, 105747, '<td valign="top">This is a familiar sight where I live here in South Florida. I would have used a level adjustment to balance the light and dark. Maybe get more separation between aligator and water. Great shot though. Good, luck Mike</td>', 'This is a familiar sight where I live here in South Florida. I would have used a level adjustment to balance the light and dark. Maybe get more separation between aligator and water. Great shot though. Good, luck Mike', '2009-04-28 17:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5455879, 783844, 105747, '<td valign="top">What a creative shot. Great photography also. Capturing the steem almost lets you smell the aroma of the coffee. Black background was a great idea. Good Luck, Mike</td>', 'What a creative shot. Great photography also. Capturing the steem almost lets you smell the aroma of the coffee. Black background was a great idea. Good Luck, Mike', '2009-04-28 17:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5455885, 783767, 105747, '<td valign="top">It does look a little out of place. I may have done some work on the cast shadow. It is a little dark and takes away from the overall photo. Now this may have been your intent, if so great job. I like the parrellel cast shadow at the top. That stright line in contrast to the curves of the hores adds tension and interest to the photo. Great job, Mike</td>', 'It does look a little out of place. I may have done some work on the cast shadow. It is a little dark and takes away from the overall photo. Now this may have been your intent, if so great job. I like the parrellel cast shadow at the top. That stright line in contrast to the curves of the hores adds tension and interest to the photo. Great job, Mike', '2009-04-28 17:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
