(5458383, 783388, 29269, '<td valign="top">Not a ribbon material, I agree, but &lt;4.0 score is wrong.<br/>There is no requirement that pics should not be grainy.... I don''t understand voters sometimes.<br/>Meets challenge, is artsy imo, so I would have scored it (if I were voting on this one) prolly 8.<br/>Commendations on an interesting image.</td>', 'Not a ribbon material, I agree, but <4.0 score is wrong.There is no requirement that pics should not be grainy.... I don''t understand voters sometimes.Meets challenge, is artsy imo, so I would have scored it (if I were voting on this one) prolly 8.Commendations on an interesting image.', '2009-04-30 02:05:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(5458388, 784335, 50034, '<td valign="top">Dude was wasted, but alas not with alcohol!  I just always look better behind the camera rather than in front of it.  I quip to friends all the time that I look better on paper than in person.<br/> <br/>After the first few scores came in I realized that my evening would been better spent getting wasted on cold medicine with an early bed time.  Dude,...IS RIGHT!!!!!!!  :/</td>', 'Dude was wasted, but alas not with alcohol!  I just always look better behind the camera rather than in front of it.  I quip to friends all the time that I look better on paper than in person. After the first few scores came in I realized that my evening would been better spent getting wasted on cold medicine with an early bed time.  Dude,...IS RIGHT!!!!!!!  :/', '2009-04-30 02:17:25.000000', NULL, 0),
