(5466507, 784256, 101256, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by lantaga:</b></div><hr/><i> Very unique image.  Tell us who/what is the model, and how you processed the image.  It actually looks like Computer Graphics. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It''s a mannequin - straight out of the camera with just a little bit of curves thrown in to increase contrast. I actually got some off line comments and complaints about it being computer generated. Pretty funny.<br/> <br/>~~ snerk ~~<br/> <br/>Later,<br/> <br/>Tom</td>', 'Originally posted by lantaga: Very unique image.  Tell us who/what is the model, and how you processed the image.  It actually looks like Computer Graphics.   It''s a mannequin - straight out of the camera with just a little bit of curves thrown in to increase contrast. I actually got some off line comments and complaints about it being computer generated. Pretty funny. ~~ snerk ~~ Later, Tom', '2009-05-03 22:16:49.000000', NULL, 0),
