(7227155, 783813, 60173, '<td valign="top">That homeowner is someone I''d like to meet. Imagine all the people telling them they''re crazy, and yet they did it anyway. The way you''ve chosen to photograph it kind of makes me laugh. You could have gotten fancy with the composition or something, but no, you chose straight on, no frills. For this challenge, it''s almost like you were saying, "Here''s this really weird house, nuff said!" There is no argument in the slightest that, indeed, something is not quite right here.</td>', 'That homeowner is someone I''d like to meet. Imagine all the people telling them they''re crazy, and yet they did it anyway. The way you''ve chosen to photograph it kind of makes me laugh. You could have gotten fancy with the composition or something, but no, you chose straight on, no frills. For this challenge, it''s almost like you were saying, "Here''s this really weird house, nuff said!" There is no argument in the slightest that, indeed, something is not quite right here.', '2014-06-11 13:38:43.000000', NULL, 0),
